s6-4-p2 : Block
s6-4-p2 = prose (cons "Take a typed source-language term \(p:\mathsf{Tm}_L(\Gamma,A)\). Its representation in the cubical language is itself a term. A function may inspect that representation, construct another term, and construct a dependent proof about the relation between their meanings. There is no need to extend the source language's runtime instruction set merely to express this calculus." nil)
